  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Stealth 10 ranks, Infiltration sphere (Traceless Presence (exceptional)).</p>\n<p>While you maintain the Traceless Presence approach, you do not break Stealth for lack of cover or concealment (although you still need some way to enter Stealth).</p>\n<p>In addition, you never need cover or concealment to use Stealth against creatures who are confused, dazed, dazzled, stunned, or have any disorientation conditions.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/infiltration#toc47\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
